  "details": "I thought there was a lack of detail on a message in the dialog about leaving the group.\n\n.\n\nMy suggestion:\n\n** Just add a detail** \n\n\"Are you sure you want to leave this group?\"\n\n.\n\n** Change the message depending on how the group joins** \n\nOpen: \"Are you sure you want to leave this group? You can rejoin this group at any time.\"\n\nClosed: \"Are you sure you want to leave this group? You can't rejoin this group.\"\n\nInvite Only: \"Are you sure you want to leave this group? You can't rejoin this group until you are invited.\"\n\nRequest Invite:  Are you sure you want to leave this group? You will need to send a request to rejoin this group.\"",
